#: CalendarTool.cpp:62
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"End date is before start date! Please make sure that end date comes after "
"start date."
msgstr "Završni datum je prije početnog! Provjerite je li završni datum nakon "
"početnog."

#: CalendarTool.cpp:62 CalendarTool.cpp:69
#, kde-format
msgid "Error"
msgstr "Pogreška"

#: CalendarTool.cpp:68
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Calendars should not be longer than 10 years. If you really need such long "
"periods you need to split them up."
msgstr "Kalendar ne bi trebao trajati dulje od 10 godina. Ako su vam doista "
"potrebna tako duga razdoblja, podijelite ih."

#: CalendarTool.cpp:76
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Start and end dates are equal! Only one day will be inserted, do you want to "
"continue?"
msgstr "Početni i završni datumi su jednaki! Umetnut će se samo jedan dan. "
"Želite li nastaviti?"

#: CalendarTool.cpp:77 CalendarTool.cpp:87 CalendarTool.cpp:111
#, kde-format
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Upozorenje"

#: CalendarTool.cpp:86
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Creating a calendar for a longer period than a year can take up a lot of "
"space, do you want to continue?"
msgstr "Stvaranje kalendara za razdoblje dulje od godine dana može zauzeti "
"mnogo prostora. Želite li nastaviti?"

#: CalendarTool.cpp:109
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The area where the calendar is inserted is NOT empty, are you sure you want "
"to continue, overwriting existing data? If you choose No the area that would "
"be required for the desired calendar will be selected so you can see what "
"data would be overwritten."
msgstr "Područje na koje se umeće kalendar NIJE prazno. Želite li doista "
"nastaviti i prebrisati postojeće podatke? Odaberete li „Ne”, označit će se "
"područje potrebno za željeni kalendar kako biste vidjeli koji bi se podaci "
"prebrisali."

#: CalendarTool.cpp:120
msgctxt "(qtundo-format)"
msgid "Insert Calendar"
msgstr "Umetni kalendar"

#: CalendarTool.cpp:126
#, kde-format
msgid "Calendar from %1 to %2"
msgstr "Kalendar od %1 do %2"

#: CalendarTool.cpp:166
#, kde-format
msgid "week"
msgstr "tjedan"

#: CalendarToolFactory.cpp:22
#, kde-format
msgid "Calendar"
msgstr "Kalendar"

